{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Propagate ordinary continuation failures into the execution.** `WaitForConditionOperation` discards this returned future, so deserialization or next-worker dispatch failures only fail an unobserved future. An executor rejection can also leave the operation registered as active, hanging the invocation indefinitely. Route failures through the manager/owner failure path before releasing the activity lease, or make every polling chain observe and propagate this future.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77xMox","finding_digest":"03e3dab64ed1cd09a776a4407e6e5b0e2c6f74d20999234577c117a7b9ad21ea","finding_id":"arf_v1_apr5vnso2hgqtj3wurah43s3by","finding_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::completecheckpointcontinuation::jvm-fatal-swallowing","identity_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::completecheckpointcontinuation::jvm-fatal-swallowing","line":606,"observation_digest":"8a68f8055368ad161098768772198d6640037b97e4cb6c52097cf8d99df22ea9","observation_id":"aro_v1_rjupqbktncwrmeeyo2dxegmnmz","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_apr5vnso2hgqtj3wurah43s3by","published_at":"2026-10-08T20:48:03Z","review_id":"arr_v1_x7jz3p7qev5bxz3oyirpg4lplp","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"b882ea7c57a688d35a0eb694629d494a98769c57","reviewer":"codex","start_line":605,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_4eavwcswj66dek2vyk5up5vmj3","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T20:48:03Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
